flowchart LR
    V["Verify R against S<br/>(person, agent, or program)"] --> Q{Conformance<br/>holds?}
    Q -- yes --> D(["Record the result:<br/>instrument, spec version,<br/>clauses checked"])
    Q -- no --> W["Decide which side is wrong<br/>a person decides;<br/>the decision is a commit"]
    W -- "R is wrong" --> RR["Repair R<br/>e.g. fix the date, the H1,<br/>the heading levels"]
    W -- "S is wrong or silent" --> AS["Amend S<br/>propose → approve → edit →<br/>version bump → changelog"]
    RR --> V
    AS --> V

    style W fill:#310066,color:#ffffff,stroke:#310066
    style D fill:#ffffff
